From: rockbandPi
Subject: [PATCH] Drop the remaining Xbox One vendor matches

xpad-noone comments out its Xbox One device entries so xone can drive
those devices, but the per-vendor XPAD_XBOXONE_VENDOR() matches were left
in the id table. They make xpad claim Xbox One interfaces (class ff/47/d0),
for example the PDP Riffmaster dongle (0e6f:0248), which then shows up as a
"Generic X-Box pad" and never reaches xone. Comment them out as well.
---
